+	 *
+	 * GICD_CTLR.RWP (bit 31) is the architectural answer to exactly that
+	 * question: the distributor sets it while a write to the register is
+	 * still being committed, and software must poll it until it clears
+	 * before it may believe a read-back.  The probe that produced "10 -> 10"
